WEBVTT

00:01.810 --> 00:03.770
<b>Zauberberg</b>

00:01.850 --> 00:03.770
<b>m 0 0 l 220 0 220 35 0 35</b>

00:05.310 --> 00:08.440
<b>Sontag</b>

00:05.310 --> 00:08.440
<b>Region</b>

00:11.820 --> 00:14.200
<b>Papal               State




Weiß Cathedral</b>

00:24.290 --> 00:27.570
Ah, Ms. Ysha. You've arrived.

00:27.570 --> 00:28.610
Hey.

00:28.610 --> 00:29.660
Wolff.

00:30.110 --> 00:32.180
You're drinking again, aren't you?

00:32.180 --> 00:35.000
How could I not?

00:38.500 --> 00:41.940
You're lucky demis live in your jurisdiction.

00:41.940 --> 00:45.620
I'm living in a nightmare because I 
have to deal with dwarves every day.

00:45.620 --> 00:48.440
Their body odor is horrendous.

00:48.440 --> 00:49.870
That's enough.

00:50.660 --> 00:56.570
You shouldn't make such speciesest remarks 
in the papal state, Bishop Wolff.

00:56.570 --> 00:59.160
Forgive me.

00:59.160 --> 01:03.530
Not only are you the first non-elf 
to be appointed a priest,

01:03.530 --> 01:06.820
but you've achieved the rank 
of archbishop, sir goblin.

01:07.160 --> 01:09.460
A person's species is irrelevant.

01:09.460 --> 01:13.420
In fact, there are plenty of elves who 
act in a manner unbecoming of elves.

01:13.980 --> 01:17.000
Well, now you've pissed me off.

01:17.000 --> 01:20.500
You wanna swap jurisdictions 
with me, archbishop goblin?!

01:20.500 --> 01:23.610
You're lucky yours is always so peaceful!

01:23.610 --> 01:26.890
It is the boon of the people's faith 
and the queen's favor.

01:26.890 --> 01:29.890
Perhaps you should try mending your ways.

01:31.010 --> 01:32.350
Looks like everyone's here.

01:32.360 --> 01:36.990
<b>Sontag Region
Weiß Cathedral
Cardinal Miller</b>

01:32.360 --> 01:36.990
<b>Sontag Region
Weiß Cathedral
Cardinal Miller</b>

01:32.600 --> 01:34.140
Cardinal Miller.

01:34.140 --> 01:36.400
Take your seats.

02:58.910 --> 03:02.410
<b>No Longer Allowed               in Another World</b>

03:02.410 --> 03:03.710
<b>[ No Longer Allowed               in Another World ]</b>

03:03.710 --> 03:06.960
<b>[ No Longer Allowed               in Another World ]</b>

03:07.780 --> 03:11.630
Forgive me for summoning you 
when you're all so busy.

03:11.630 --> 03:17.400
I'd like to begin by having each region 
make their report, but first...

03:27.510 --> 03:29.620
Ow...

03:31.210 --> 03:34.310
S-Sorry I'm late!

03:36.490 --> 03:38.780
This is your first time meeting 
one another, is it not?

03:38.780 --> 03:41.940
She's the new bishop of Ersten Temple.

03:42.590 --> 03:49.150
Please introduce yourselves 
as you make your reports.

03:50.200 --> 03:51.920
It's nice to meet all of you.

03:51.920 --> 03:54.050
I am Bishop Annette's replacement.

03:51.960 --> 03:59.380
<b>Deanstark Region
Ersten Temple
Bishop Aria</b>

03:54.050 --> 03:56.810
I am Aria of Ersten Temple.

03:56.810 --> 03:59.380
Though I lack experience, 
I appreciate your support.

03:59.380 --> 04:02.100
Do you have any information to share?

04:02.100 --> 04:06.810
Deanstark, the Holy Land of Mountains 
and Flames, has nothing to report.

04:06.810 --> 04:10.960
I heard Charlotte, the daughter of the 
King of Roth, has inherited the throne.

04:11.290 --> 04:16.060
Oh, right! I'm sorry!

04:14.570 --> 04:17.050
<i>Is this girl okay?</i>

04:17.050 --> 04:19.530
Uh, um...

04:20.090 --> 04:24.040
I am Elton, archbishop of Vierten Temple.

04:23.320 --> 04:26.740
<b>Mittwoch Region
Vierten Temple
Archbishop Elton</b>

04:24.040 --> 04:26.740
It is a pleasure to meet you, Lady Aria.

04:27.260 --> 04:32.590
Peace and calm continue to prevail in 
my jurisdiction of the Mittwoch Region,

04:32.590 --> 04:34.730
the Holy Land of Lakes and Water.

04:34.730 --> 04:36.960
We are not experiencing any problems.

04:36.960 --> 04:40.670
It is proof of the Pope's authority.

04:42.210 --> 04:45.970
By the way, Bishop Aria, 
tardiness is strictly prohibited.

04:45.970 --> 04:46.680
Right!

04:46.970 --> 04:49.850
I'm Wolff from Dritten Temple.

04:49.350 --> 04:51.520
<b>Samstag Region
Dritten Temple
Bishop Wolff</b>

04:49.850 --> 04:51.510
Nice to meet you, newbie.

04:52.020 --> 04:56.460
My jurisdiction of Samstag, 
the Holy Land of Deserts and Earth,

04:56.460 --> 05:00.730
is way out in the sticks, 
but we're managing all right.

05:00.730 --> 05:04.590
I hear there are frequent 
conflicts between the dwarves.

05:04.590 --> 05:06.650
It's an everyday occurrence.

05:06.650 --> 05:09.110
They even hit me when I tried to mediate.

05:10.460 --> 05:12.450
I am Ysha of Zweiden Temple.

05:12.450 --> 05:14.910
<b>Donnerstag Region
Zweiden Temple
Bishop Ysha</b>

05:12.450 --> 05:14.910
<b>Donnerstag Region
Zweiden Temple
Bishop Ysha</b>

05:12.750 --> 05:14.910
It's nice to meet you, Bishop Aria.

05:15.620 --> 05:20.560
Several days ago in my jurisdiction of 
Donnerstag, the Holy Land of Forests and Wind,

05:20.560 --> 05:27.630
an Other Worlder went on a rampage 
and destroyed half the town of Veil.

05:28.020 --> 05:29.910
We are currently working 
to restore the town.

05:31.310 --> 05:32.840
An Other Worlder, eh?

05:33.180 --> 05:38.560
I actually summoned you here today 
to discuss the Other Worlders.

05:38.830 --> 05:41.060
As I informed you in my message,

05:41.060 --> 05:44.770
the Wrathful Dark Lord was defeated 
by a group of Other Worlders.

05:45.220 --> 05:50.150
In light of this, the Pope has 
decided to seal the magic circles

05:50.150 --> 05:54.240
connecting our world to others and 
cease summoning Other Worlders.

05:54.550 --> 05:58.890
I'm glad the battle against the 
detestable Dark Lord has ended.

05:58.890 --> 06:05.220
Good grief. We're finally free from 
looking after those addled Other Worlders.

06:06.580 --> 06:08.680
Getting down to business...

06:13.880 --> 06:18.050
The seven Other Worlders who 
defeated the Wrathful Dark Lord

06:18.050 --> 06:22.560
have claimed the Dark Lord's 
lands and become its new rulers.

06:23.770 --> 06:24.740
What?!

06:24.740 --> 06:30.450
And just recently, the Pope received 
a declaration from those seven.

06:30.790 --> 06:32.380
They claimed,

06:32.380 --> 06:36.400
"With our might, we shall transform all 
the lands of Zauberberg into a utopia."

06:36.400 --> 06:39.680
H-How dare they?!

06:39.680 --> 06:41.630
I don't like the sound of that.

06:41.630 --> 06:43.330
What did the Pope say?

06:43.330 --> 06:47.130
The Pope is greatly distressed.

06:47.130 --> 06:48.750
But of course he is.

06:48.750 --> 06:54.310
The Pope believed the Other Worlders 
were angels sent to save our world

06:54.310 --> 06:57.490
and freely gave his love to them.

06:57.490 --> 07:02.360
These people he considered his own children 
have now bared their fangs against him.

07:02.800 --> 07:06.670
Either way, we should consider 
this a declaration of war

07:06.670 --> 07:10.250
against the world's church of Hellsehen.

07:11.050 --> 07:18.390
The seven archangels who saved the world 
have become seven fallen angels threatening it.

07:18.390 --> 07:22.020
At the same time, we must not 
ignore the fallen Other Worlders

07:22.020 --> 07:25.160
who have begun causing 
chaos in each region.

07:25.570 --> 07:31.630
Waldelia, the daughter of the Wrathful 
Dark Lord who disappeared from his castle,

07:31.630 --> 07:33.580
cannot be overlooked, either.

07:34.640 --> 07:39.390
Ladies and gentlemen, 
Zauberberg has entered a new era.

07:39.760 --> 07:45.360
And it is our mission to overcome these 
difficulties and protect the peace.

07:45.360 --> 07:49.710
The Seven Fallen Angels, fallen Other 
Worlders, and the Dark Lord's daughter.

07:49.710 --> 07:51.930
We've a mountain of problems to deal with.

07:51.930 --> 07:55.180
I never thought the Other Worlders 
would become our enemies.

07:55.180 --> 07:58.830
If they work together, they'll become a 
far bigger problem than the Dark Lord.

07:58.830 --> 08:04.050
But how are we meant to fight 
such powerful people?

08:12.200 --> 08:16.150
There may be a way to defeat 
the Other Worlders.

08:16.510 --> 08:17.950
Bishop Ysha?

08:17.950 --> 08:20.930
I met a certain Other Worlder in Veil.

08:21.410 --> 08:26.940
He used his Gift to send an Other 
Worlder back to his own world.

08:26.940 --> 08:27.960
What?!

08:27.960 --> 08:30.910
Such a power exists?

08:31.900 --> 08:37.490
With his Gift, we may be able to send the 
Other Worlders back to their home worlds.

08:37.980 --> 08:40.900
Is this true,

08:42.310 --> 08:44.780
Ysha, my friend?

08:45.950 --> 08:47.290
Your Holiness!

08:49.580 --> 08:54.750
That angel may be our ray of hope.

08:55.540 --> 08:59.400
Will you tell me more 
about him, Bishop Ysha?

09:23.740 --> 09:26.840
Are you thinking about your beloved again?

09:43.190 --> 09:48.070
Our allies have departed for various lands.

09:52.370 --> 09:58.050
We shall remain here and observe 
what's in store for this world.

10:08.400 --> 10:11.820
Let's spend the night here 
before we enter Grün.

10:12.740 --> 10:15.510
Finally, we get to sleep in beds!

10:17.170 --> 10:22.210
<i>Due to diligent training, 
Tama (Temp) has risen to level 17.</i>

10:23.310 --> 10:25.860
Who levels up from dragging a coffin?

10:26.530 --> 10:28.440
You have Sensei to thank for that.

10:28.740 --> 10:30.730
Now, where is the inn?

10:30.730 --> 10:32.890
There's an inn at the end of this road.

10:34.600 --> 10:36.060
That way.

10:36.060 --> 10:38.310
Why, thank you.

10:39.410 --> 10:41.720
Are you travelers?

10:41.720 --> 10:45.220
Interested in some information that 
will help you on your adventures?

10:46.380 --> 10:50.270
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

10:46.890 --> 10:50.270
I Am Someone
 Who Wishes 
to Die, Not 
a Corpse 
That's Already 
Dead

10:50.270 --> 10:51.100
I Am Someone
 Who Wishes 
to Die, Not 
a Corpse 
That's Already 
Dead

10:50.270 --> 10:51.140
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

10:51.100 --> 10:51.140
I Am Someone
 Who Wishes 
to Die, Not 
a Corpse 
That's Already 
Dead

10:51.140 --> 10:51.180
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

10:51.140 --> 10:51.180
I Am Someone
 Who Wishes 
to Die, Not 
a Corpse 
That's Already 
Dead

10:51.190 --> 10:51.230
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

10:51.230 --> 10:51.310
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

10:51.310 --> 10:51.350
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

10:53.890 --> 10:56.450
Hero Introduction Service?

10:56.450 --> 10:59.860
Yeah, also known as the Other 
Worlder Dispatch Service.

10:59.860 --> 11:01.170
What is that?

11:01.170 --> 11:09.210
<b>HERO</b>

11:01.520 --> 11:05.010
Other Worlders are assigned to accompany 
parties that lack confidence in their skills,

11:05.010 --> 11:07.610
providing them with a safe 
and comfortable journey.

11:07.610 --> 11:09.170
I came up with the business idea.

11:09.500 --> 11:12.570
Uh... Other Worlders?

11:12.980 --> 11:15.510
What's with the reaction?

11:15.510 --> 11:18.000
Other Worlders are heroes 
who will save our world.

11:18.000 --> 11:19.230
Don't you know that?

11:20.730 --> 11:23.670
Well? Act now, and I'll introduce 
you to an Other Worlder

11:23.670 --> 11:26.380
I can vouch for personally 
for just 40,000 jenico.

11:26.380 --> 11:29.840
Sorry, ask someone else. 
We don't have that much—

11:30.060 --> 11:32.330
We'd like one valiant warrior, please.

11:32.330 --> 11:34.040
Hey, what do you think you're doing?!

11:34.040 --> 11:36.910
We're talking 40,000 here! 
Don't you understand that?!

11:36.910 --> 11:39.790
A small price to pay for Sensei's safety.

11:41.750 --> 11:44.210
A life is priceless.

11:44.460 --> 11:50.110
This dead man is probably wishing for 
your safety from beyond the grave.

11:50.110 --> 11:56.120
He'd be smiling up in heaven if he 
knew a hero were accompanying you.

11:56.120 --> 11:58.200
Sorry I'm still alive.

12:01.370 --> 12:03.670
Th-The corpse spoke?!

12:03.670 --> 12:09.240
How rude. I am someone who wishes to die, 
not a corpse that's already dead.

12:13.690 --> 12:17.370
Despite how he seems, 
Sensei is a hero, as well.

12:17.370 --> 12:19.500
What are you talking about?

12:19.500 --> 12:23.550
Heroes don't have faces that 
look like verdigris on a sword.

12:23.550 --> 12:26.290
I hate those kinds of 
descriptive expressions.

12:26.920 --> 12:29.060
In any case...

12:30.380 --> 12:31.700
I'm Nir!

12:31.700 --> 12:34.970
I'll bring you a real adventurer, 
so wait for me at the inn!

12:34.970 --> 12:37.110
Thank you!

12:37.970 --> 12:40.990
If a valiant warrior is joining our party,

12:40.990 --> 12:45.120
we'll finally be freed 
from dragging his coffin.

12:45.440 --> 12:47.670
What? I'm not letting 
anyone else take this job.

12:47.670 --> 12:49.920
You <i>want</i> to pull that thing?

13:00.120 --> 13:02.770
Are you staying or not?

13:03.130 --> 13:06.960
G-Give us a few more minutes. 
We're waiting for someone.

13:06.960 --> 13:10.970
That boy won't be returning.

13:10.970 --> 13:11.670
What?

13:12.230 --> 13:16.390
He had the eyes of an adult.

13:16.390 --> 13:20.520
Are you waiting for a kid named Nir?

13:20.520 --> 13:23.640
Don't tell me you gave him any money.

13:23.640 --> 13:26.600
We did. He said he'd introduce us to a hero.

13:27.410 --> 13:30.750
Again? That's one of his standard methods.

13:30.750 --> 13:32.030
Method?

13:32.030 --> 13:33.710
Y-You mean...

13:33.930 --> 13:37.000
That kid has never even met an adventurer.

13:37.000 --> 13:39.380
There's no way he could 
introduce you to one.

13:39.380 --> 13:42.660
You were fooled by Big Mouth Nir.

13:43.330 --> 13:48.130
Annette?! Pull yourself together!

13:44.260 --> 13:46.550
F-Forty thousand...

13:46.550 --> 13:48.130
Oh, gods...

13:48.570 --> 13:49.630
Take deep breaths!

13:49.630 --> 13:52.650
Breathe in! And out! And in!

13:52.240 --> 13:54.660
A-Are you okay?

13:52.650 --> 13:55.980
An out! And in! And out!

13:56.510 --> 13:59.670
Forgive me. I lost my mind for a moment.

13:59.670 --> 14:02.500
So, what's this about Big Mouth Nir?

14:02.500 --> 14:03.360
Right.

14:03.820 --> 14:08.400
He's an orphan who started 
living in town at some point.

14:08.400 --> 14:14.240
He makes a living fooling visitors who 
come to this town from time to time.

14:14.510 --> 14:17.910
He doesn't have any adults 
in his life to scold him.

14:17.910 --> 14:20.640
He's the town nuisance.

14:20.640 --> 14:23.450
Sometimes I feel sorry for him.

14:25.810 --> 14:32.020
Those heroes he talks about must not exist.

14:32.760 --> 14:39.940
If such great people truly exist, 
why won't they save him?

14:40.220 --> 14:45.060
How long are they going to 
let Nir keep doing that?

15:00.100 --> 15:02.630
Let go! Let go of me!

15:10.030 --> 15:13.300
Well, well. Looks like you've 
got a small fortune saved up.

15:14.030 --> 15:15.800
Lucky us.

15:17.330 --> 15:20.030
What are you going to do to me?

15:22.750 --> 15:25.680
What do you think's gonna happen to you?

15:29.130 --> 15:33.860
My Other Worlder friends won't 
let anything happen to me!

15:35.280 --> 15:38.330
Don't you get it, Big Mouth?

15:41.440 --> 15:45.410
We're Other Worlders.

15:45.410 --> 15:47.810
First time seeing an overpowered ability?

15:50.390 --> 15:51.770
You're kidding, right?

15:51.770 --> 15:57.230
This is the ultimate weapon that can 
pierce even a dragon's hide, Mad Gear!

15:57.550 --> 16:01.300
We hear you've been using 
our name to make a tidy sum.

16:01.300 --> 16:03.930
You make me wanna barf, 
you evil little kid.

16:04.330 --> 16:07.020
And bad boys...

16:07.020 --> 16:10.150
...must be righteously punished.

16:10.470 --> 16:16.630
You can brag to everyone in the afterlife 
that you were killed by a hero.

16:16.630 --> 16:19.170
Begin the countdown! Five...

16:19.820 --> 16:24.160
<i>These guys are heroes who 
will save our world?</i>

16:24.510 --> 16:25.380
Four...

16:26.880 --> 16:27.910
Three...

16:27.910 --> 16:29.710
<i>Figures.</i>

16:29.710 --> 16:30.720
Two...

16:31.890 --> 16:33.690
You shouldn't lie.

16:36.350 --> 16:37.960
That hurts!

16:37.960 --> 16:39.550
Wh-Who the hell are you?!

16:39.990 --> 16:44.280
People like you shouldn't be called heroes.

16:44.280 --> 16:46.230
Y-You're...

16:46.850 --> 16:53.950
It's because adults like you lie so 
casually that children imitate you.

16:53.950 --> 16:55.920
God Analyze!

16:55.910 --> 16:59.120
<b>m 0 0 l 90 0 90 20 0 20</b>

16:55.910 --> 16:59.120
<b>Other Worlder</b>

16:59.720 --> 17:01.000
Boss, this is bad!

17:01.000 --> 17:01.740
What is it?

17:02.010 --> 17:03.720
He's an Other Worlder, too!

17:03.720 --> 17:04.840
What?

17:05.710 --> 17:11.800
<b>For Commercial Use
Calmotin
Sedative</b>

17:06.120 --> 17:08.630
No, wait! I take it back!

17:08.630 --> 17:11.790
Not only does he only have one 
hit point, he's poisoned, too!

17:12.050 --> 17:15.720
What's he doing? Is he 
on some sketchy drugs?

17:16.380 --> 17:18.020
You scared us.

17:18.020 --> 17:21.060
As punishment for scaring some heroes,

17:21.060 --> 17:24.980
we'll make you suffer like you never 
have before, and then kill you!

17:24.980 --> 17:29.180
Kill you... kill you... kill you...

17:29.180 --> 17:31.640
What did you say?

17:32.640 --> 17:34.010
Boss, this is bad!

17:34.010 --> 17:35.460
What now?

17:35.870 --> 17:39.490
His vitality is rising like crazy!

17:39.490 --> 17:40.450
What?!

17:40.450 --> 17:42.710
He's probably in a super excited state!

17:42.710 --> 17:44.210
U-Under these circumstances?!

17:45.620 --> 17:49.150
Were you planning to shoot 
me dead with that bow?

17:51.460 --> 17:54.020
Such a dandy plan.

17:55.150 --> 17:59.920
Make sure you aim right here.

18:04.470 --> 18:06.700
He's... He's...

18:07.250 --> 18:10.060
He's a pervert!

18:11.990 --> 18:16.110
Good grief. They were liars to the end.

18:17.780 --> 18:19.320
H-Hey!

18:19.670 --> 18:22.850
Are you a hero?

18:22.850 --> 18:24.510
A hero?

18:25.290 --> 18:28.300
I'm nothing so grand.

18:35.660 --> 18:37.070
As it should be.

18:37.070 --> 18:38.920
Wh-What?

18:40.740 --> 18:45.360
Adults are youths who have been betrayed.

18:46.270 --> 18:49.300
But you're still a child.

18:50.560 --> 18:53.690
You're not ready to become an adult yet.

18:54.980 --> 18:56.280
For now,

18:57.040 --> 18:59.850
that's the look you should have in your eyes.

19:06.130 --> 19:07.080
Huh?

19:07.440 --> 19:10.700
Hey, wait! You're not going to untie me?!

19:16.610 --> 19:20.960
Come. Let's head straight to Grün.

19:20.960 --> 19:23.550
Huh? Sensei, did not you 
not get enough sleep?

19:24.300 --> 19:27.230
Come to think of it, 
where did you go last night?

19:28.760 --> 19:31.680
What? Were you with a woman?

19:31.680 --> 19:34.030
I had a truly delightful night.

19:34.030 --> 19:35.400
"Delightful"?!

19:35.400 --> 19:37.400
What did you do, Sensei?!

19:37.400 --> 19:40.850
Please tell me, Sensei!

19:40.850 --> 19:42.360
Now, now...

19:42.360 --> 19:44.830
Whatever. Let's get moving.

19:46.350 --> 19:47.300
Hey.

19:47.300 --> 19:49.910
There you are, Big Mouth Nir!

19:50.170 --> 19:52.840
You liar! Give us back our money!

19:52.840 --> 19:54.100
Now, now...

19:54.100 --> 19:57.430
No way. I didn't lie to you.

19:57.430 --> 19:58.040
What?!

19:59.050 --> 20:03.260
Didn't I say I'd introduce 
you to a valiant warrior?

20:04.110 --> 20:05.120
Huh?

20:05.120 --> 20:08.200
Y-You can't mean...

20:08.970 --> 20:12.980
<b>Trainee Swordsman Nir joined the party.</b>

21:47.770 --> 21:50.880
<i>Landmark Castle Grün discovered.</i>

21:50.880 --> 21:53.900
<i>Sensei has gained five experience points.</i>

21:55.660 --> 21:56.860
I want to die.

21:56.860 --> 21:59.310
Huh?! What brought that on?

21:59.310 --> 22:01.290
Did something painful happen to you?

22:01.860 --> 22:05.000
There isn't a day when living isn't painful.

22:05.000 --> 22:09.080
B-Bad news! Sensei says he wants to die!

22:09.080 --> 22:12.380
Uh-huh. Anyway, the weather sure is nice today.

22:12.380 --> 22:14.590
Huh? What kind of reaction is that?!

22:14.590 --> 22:17.370
More importantly, Nir, it's 
about time you swapped with me.

22:17.370 --> 22:19.060
What? No way.

22:19.430 --> 22:22.430
How long are you going to make 
a lady drag this coffin?

22:22.430 --> 22:24.660
You're a valiant warrior, aren't you?

22:24.660 --> 22:26.110
Aw, man.

22:29.290 --> 22:33.340
Tama, Nia, Sensei. I see our destination.

22:33.910 --> 22:37.740
That is Tama's homeland, the city of Grün.

22:44.130 --> 22:46.450
I haven't been back in ages!

22:46.450 --> 22:48.440
I wonder how everyone's doing!

22:48.440 --> 22:49.210
Tama...

22:49.210 --> 22:51.940
There seems to be an inspection checkpoint.

22:51.940 --> 22:54.480
I'll get us through.

22:54.480 --> 22:57.380
I'm actually a bit famous around here.

23:01.900 --> 23:02.780
Huh?

23:02.780 --> 23:06.360
Don't try to resist! 
You're all under arrest!

23:06.750 --> 23:09.430
Famous, huh?

23:09.430 --> 23:11.090
H-Huh?

23:11.890 --> 23:13.290
Under arrest?

23:14.940 --> 23:21.160
Let us out! We haven't done anything!

23:21.160 --> 23:26.130
Oh, gods! Please save us!

23:30.480 --> 23:32.170
There are no gods...

23:32.170 --> 23:33.600
Which is it?

23:34.750 --> 23:37.650
Save us, gods...

23:37.650 --> 23:39.850
There are no gods...
